[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3480.87, "timestamp": "00:58:00", "text": "知道。但是，呃，你的虚拟助理怎么样了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3485.75, "timestamp": "00:58:05", "text": "我醒来后在做什么？你猜怎么着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3491.15, "timestamp": "00:58:11", "text": "早上6点，不，6点。下午6点。不，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3496.63, "timestamp": "00:58:16", "text": "你们五个。我晚上7点醒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3498.349, "timestamp": "00:58:18", "text": "晚上7点你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3500.95, "timestamp": "00:58:20", "text": "你还能做多久的你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3502.87, "timestamp": "00:58:22", "text": "醒？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3506.71, "timestamp": "00:58:26", "text": "我大概凌晨1点或12点睡觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3509.03, "timestamp": "00:58:29", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3511.47, "timestamp": "00:58:31", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3519.71, "timestamp": "00:58:39", "text": "等等，呃，等等，凌晨1点还是下午1点？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3524.069, "timestamp": "00:58:44", "text": "圣。我的天啊。我当时太兴奋了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3528.23, "timestamp": "00:58:48", "text": "夜里不知何故。我不知道为什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3530.34, "timestamp": "00:58:50", "text": "是的。"}]